Subject: [PATCH 6/7] reduced SpacemiT K3 vendor BSP: add UART (no SPI)
 defconfig

Do Not Merge

Informational purpose only, to aid mainline development of SpacemiT K3
support.

Drop QSPI SPI MTD CLK and RESET as a new defconfig
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [Do Not Merge informational series, https://lore.kernel.org/u-boot/20261029001555.1890775-1-e@freeshell.de/]
---
 configs/spacemit_k3_uart_nospi_defconfig | 44 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 44 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 configs/spacemit_k3_uart_nospi_defconfig

